"╭ ╭ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮"
"│ │ Everywhere                                    Everywhere (continued)                         │ │"
"│ │  Tab         Next pane                         Ctrl-Q      Quit                              │ │"
"│ │  Shift-Tab   Previous pane                    Room list                                      │ │"
"│▌│  Alt-←       Go to the room list               ↑           Previous room                     │ │"
"│ │  Alt-→       Go back to the chat               ↓           Next room                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↑       Go to the messages                Enter       Open room and start typing        │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↓       Go to the composer                ?           This help                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-1       Room list                        Messages                                       │ │"
"│ │  Alt-2       Messages                          ↑           Select older message              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-3       Composer                          ↓           Newer message, then composer      │ │"
"│ │  Alt-R       Filter rooms                      Enter       Reply to selected message         │ │"
"│ │  PgUp        Scroll messages up                e           Edit (own messages)               │ │"
"│ │  PgDn        Scroll messages down              r           React with an emoji               │ │"
"│ │  Esc         Close, cancel or go back          Del         Delete message                    │ │"
"│ │  Alt-E       Emoji picker                      c           Copy text                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-A       Attach a file                     C           Copy code block                   │ │"
"│ │  F1          This help                         s           Save file or picture              │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↑      Previous room                     v           View picture                      │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↓      Next room                         o           Open link, picture or file        │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-F      Find in this room                 t           Open the message's thread         │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-G      Search all rooms                  p           Go to replied message             │ │"
"│ │  Alt-U       Jump to first unread              P           Pinned messages                   │ │"
"│ │  Alt-S       Next space (then all rooms)       T           Threads of this room              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-O       Filter: Unread only               d           Try decrypting again              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-D       Filter: People only               m           Menu for the message              │─╯"
"│ │  Ctrl-K      Find a room                       i           Message details                   │─╮"
"│ │  F2          Settings                          End         Jump to newest                    │ │"
"╰─│  F3          Next theme                        ?           This help                         │─╯"
